## poka_yoke.rs

poka-yoke-ligue_o_dispositivo_a_um = Link the device to an FMEA failure mode.
poka-yoke-dispositivo_de_controle_que_nao = Control device that did not lower the occurrence: review the O rating or the function.
poka-yoke-dispositivo_de_alerta_que_nao = Warning device that did not lower the detection: review the D rating or the function.
poka-yoke-uma_nota_subiu_depois_do = A rating went up after the device.
poka-yoke-diga_de_quantos_em_quantos = Say every how many days it is checked.
poka-yoke-ainda_nao_foi_verificado = Not checked yet.
poka-yoke-verificacao_atrasada_desde = Check overdue since { $d }.
poka-yoke-na_ultima_verificacao_ele_nao = It did not work at the last check: the failure mode is unprotected.

## qfd.rs

qfd-nenhum_requisito_atende_a_necessidade = No requirement meets the need "{ $nome }".
qfd-a_necessidade_so_tem_relacoes = The need "{ $nome }" has only weak relationships: a requirement that measures it well is missing.
qfd-o_requisito_nao_se_relaciona = The requirement "{ $nome }" relates to no need.
qfd-o_requisito_esta_sem_valor = The requirement "{ $nome }" has no target value.
qfd-e_estao_entre_os_mais = "{ $a }" and "{ $b }" are among the most important and work against each other: resolve the conflict in the design.

